isibleTab), sends it to gemini-2.5-computer-use-preview-10-2025 and executes the returned actions by dispatching synthetic DOM mouse and keyboard events at the given coordinates from its content script; the Electron app captures its view with webContents.capturePage and injects equivalent JavaScript. Model calls go directly from the client with a user-supplied Google API key; the Composio key for Tool Router mode is optional. There is no LICENSE file and GitHub reports no license, so the code license is unknown. No GitHub releases; the extension manifest is version 1.0.0.","published_at":null,"relations":[{"evidence_url":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/composio-community/open-chatgpt-atlas/15a4261954a13322bc8af54ce1434d9b6f3d189d/sidepanel.tsx","target_id":"url:879d4e3e75e83582bde6","type":"uses"}],"review_status":"curated","scope":"core","summary":"Chrome side-panel extension and Electron browser in which Gemini 2.5 Computer Use reads tab screenshots and returns clicks, typing, scrolling and navigation, with an optional Composio tool-router mode.","topics":["web-navigation","tool-integration"],"updated_at":null,"url":"https://github.com/composio-community/open-chatgpt-atlas"}
